@title Enter goes to the dialog on top, not the drawing under the pointer
@area Editor
# Renumber I/O opens a dialog; Enter must apply it while the pointer rests over the drawing
# (before the fix the drawing took the key as "finish wire").
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text plc cards
wait 6
click_text "PLC Cards and I/O"
wait 40
move 700 420
wait 4
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text renumber io
wait 6
key Enter
wait 10
shot dialog
expect "Renumber (Enter)"
key Enter
wait 20
shot applied
expect_not "Renumber (Enter)"
expect "Renumbered I/O"
check_layout
